OL,3,GNEWSAHow one man built a sporting talks
OL,4,Alegacy                                 
OL,6,FFor nearly half a century, one man has 
OL,7,Fbeen responsible for bringing some of  
OL,8,Fthe biggest names in sport to a small  
OL,9,Fclub in Herefordshire.                 
OL,11,FSince 1980, John Beaman has organised  
OL,12,Fmonthly sporting dinners at            
OL,13,FLeominster's Rankin Club, attracting   
OL,14,Fstars from across the world to share   
OL,15,Ftheir stories with local audiences and 
OL,16,Fraise money for charity.               
OL,18,FNow, the event is preparing to mark a  
OL,19,Fmajor milestone with its 500th talk.   
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
