OL,3,GNEWSAHow one man built a sporting talks
OL,4,Alegacy                                 
OL,6,FOver the years, Beaman has welcomed an 
OL,7,Fextraordinary list of guests, including
OL,8,FSebastian Coe, Ian Botham and Bob      
OL,9,FChampion, despite never owning a mobile
OL,10,Fphone or computer.                     
